    {
      "uid": "zhcn:07a126ccc2e6fab03d04633c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "那，我去痛快发泄自己的欲求不满了！\r\n好好把那烙在眼球上哦ーー！",
      "source_fingerprint": "52790a4bf6c742bb9cd047f43c4f82d381be607940aa0af3df2091c0705cca2f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
